                              </p><p id="cc-id-sj4c1NhE9sLG"></p><h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-8 text-gray-900 serif-font" href="" id="cc-id-ATT9krKTvPAF">
                                The "Leaky Pipe" That 2x's Your Dark Spots Every
                                Year (And How to Fix It for Good…)
                              </h2><img class="fk-image-defaults" src="{{ '1777377153302_skin_animation_optimized.gif' | asset_url }}" id="cc-id-AMR6rxK1R3bX" title="" href="" onclick="" target="_self" alt="" align="center" width="" height="" loading="lazy"><p class="mb-10" href="" id="cc-id-NrzwTPVcjNXi">
                                You see, when most women notice dark spots, they
